e head, merge base, authorized scope, original commit identity, and pre-rebase repository snapshot before rebase.","reconciliation":"Use Git rebase state plus effect trailer, parent lineage, exact manifest delta, and remote head. A completed exact integrated commit is ALREADY_APPLIED; fully restored original state is NOT_APPLIED; partial/conflicting rebase or scope drift is INDETERMINATE and must fail closed."},"isolated-integrate-and-resume":{"effect_identity":"authorization receipt id plus source commit/state hash plus fetched remote head plus manifest/overlay/message hashes","prepare":"Persist source snapshot, remote snapshot, deterministic isolated commit metadata, and temporary-workspace identity before cloning.","reconciliation":"Query the remote for the exact effect trailer and authorized tree delta. A matching remote head with unchanged source is ALREADY_APPLIED; unchanged remote/source with no effect commit is NOT_APPLIED; remote advance, conflicting effect marker, or changed source is INDETERMINATE."},"isolated-reconcile-and-resume":{"effect_identity":"authorization receipt id plus source commit/state hash plus fetched remote head/merge base plus manifest/overlay hashes plus canonical ledger event-id set hash","prepare":"Persist source and remote snapshots, approved semantic paths, canonical ledger identities, and deterministic isolated commit metadata before reconciliation.","reconciliation":"Require the exact effect-marked remote commit, authorized tree delta, canonical ledger union, regenerated blocker view, and byte-identical source snapshot for ALREADY_APPLIED. Unchanged remote/source with no effect commit is NOT_APPLIED; any semantic, remote, or source disagreement is INDETERMINATE."},"publish":{"effect_identity":"authorization receipt id plus repository identity plus initial HEAD plus branch plus remote-url hash plus manifest/content hash plus approved message hash","local_reconciliation":"If HEAD is the prepared initial HEAD and the index is empty, the local mutation is NOT_APPLIED. If HEAD is one direct child carrying the exact Prevention-Effect-ID trailer, approved message, parent, author/committer policy, and manifest-only tree delta, it is ALREADY_APPLIED_LOCAL. Any other HEAD/index/scope state is INDETERMINATE.","prepare":"Persist all identity fields, source/index/worktree snapshots, deterministic effect trailer, and authorization consumption before git add.","remote_reconciliation":"Resolve the remote branch head. Exact equality to the identified local effect commit is ALREADY_APPLIED_REMOTE; the prepared prior remote head with local effect commit retained is NOT_APPLIED_REMOTE; remote advance, missing effect commit, or conflicting effect marker is INDETERMINATE."},"resume-push":{"effect_identity":"authorization receipt id plus repository identity plus exact effect-marked HEAD commit plus branch and remote-url hash","reconciliation":"Require the exact prepared effect commit at HEAD, empty index, and unchanged authorized identities; reconcile the remote branch exactly as publish without creating another commit."},"resume_rule":"Continue only the first NOT_APPLIED stage. Never create a second effect-marked commit or push after ALREADY_APPLIED_REMOTE; every INDETERMINATE state stops without force push, reset, stash, or destructive cleanup."},"policy_sha256":"95edd938cf67b136f9f53b867b75bc2885b8b34d4cd70df5f744fdbc6de980bd","required_clause_ids":["0b4eb0a53a40c81b72ba12dcbc5ba2d53be621e38cfd027c38af37451be9b3ae","114b13e8debabeca08090402de2c65e76900e0a76666d30d2cdfbb8a2b0ba0fd","2c6e885e38e92566f0e8e873c833d4258afb72ed347c39d4177950b4d2a3dd8f","3c6b313dac92b752a2a5707a3643b26c084e1da13f3caa02f3ecc5230d524962","3d4f4395ba7eafdccb4ad0bedb905dc5c314d05908a73bd1ae6335dec784b40a","4153fff46752ceaf96ad3bda030d72d5795d6b6ffe4bec7c857e4da29b3d724b","41e6ac97daff8cef82187fb57f283270816c921f9e0ddc0ebda5c9247a70caad","50dc325f18e235cee169e032d5e49d12bd2b82a8cddb42a252d31c795069b7e8","72ba3599b08148049091d84a8e07d97b9f